            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 10:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Abo abatabuulirizangaku bingemaku, nabagha okuunoonia era abo abatandhagalangaku nabaganha okumbona. Eighanga eritayetangaku liina lyange, nalivugira nti, ‘Ndi ghano, ndi ghano.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olunaku lwonalwona nayandhuluzanga emikono gyange okusangaaza abantu abadheemu, abeebisa mu nsambo etali nkalamu nga bajiira ku ebyo beene bye bayiiya okukola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bansoononkereza ekiseera kyonakyona nga bagheera emisengo mu nimiro dhe baasengamu emisambwa, era nga baniokeza obubbaani mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwire baja mu lwambiidhi omuziikibwa abantu, baatyama ku magombe era baaba mu bifo ebyekusifu. Balya emamba y'embiidhi, baawuutira mu bibya byaibwe omuunhu ogw'omu mamba eyenhinhalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakoba banaibwe bati, ‘Mwemerere ere ghala, mutatuseetaku. Ife baatulondamu, tituli ng'oti niimwe.’ Aye nze tisobola kuguminkiriza bantu bali ng'oti n'abo. Bangemya obusungu obwokya ng'oti muliro ogutazikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona, nze nasalagho era kyamala ira okughandiikibwa nga ndibabonereza. Ekyo tija kukisirikira naire. Bwenebwene ndibabonereza, naabeesasuulizaaku nga njiira ku bye baakola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olw'ebibi byaibwe ghalala n'ebya badhaadha baibwe kuba baaniokezanga obubbaani ku nsozi enene, era banvumiranga ku busozi obutono. Kale ni ndibabonereza, naabeesasuulizaaku nga njiira ku bye baakola. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda era akoba ati: “Ng'abantu bwe balondamu emizabbibu emirungi ni bagikunhamu omwenge, nga bakoba bati, ‘Egyo mutagizikiriza kuba giri n'omugaso,’ zeena ntyo bwe ndikola ku lw'abagheereza bange, ndobe kubazikiriza boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nditaagho ku baidhukulu ba Yakobo n'aba Yuda, baatwala ensi eyo erimu ensozi dhange. Abantu bange abo be nalondamu era abagheereza bange abo baligitwala yaaba yaibwe ku bwaibwe, era baagibangamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balinsinzizanga e Sharoni era baatwalanga ebyayo byaibwe, baabyayira mu biketezo eby'e Sharoni eyo, ate byawuumuliranga mu kyetebwa Ekiiko eky'Ebizibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye embeera eriba yindi eri imwe abanvaaku nze Musengwa Katonda, ni mwerabira Sioni olusozi lwange olutukuvu, ni musinza omusambwa Gadi gwe bakoba mbu guleetera abantu okuba ab'enkabi, n'omusambwa Meni gwe bakoba mbu n'oguleetera ebyo ebituuka ku bantu okubaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe muliitirwa mu ntalo mwatirimbulwa kuba bwe nabeeta timwanvugira waire okufaayo okuwulirisa bye nkoba. Aye mwakola ebibi ye ndi, mwalondagho okukola ebitansangaaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, nze Musengwa Katonda nkoba nti, abo abansinza balirya era baanhwa, aye imwe endhala eribaluma n'endiwo yaabagema. Beene balisagamba, aye imwe muliswazibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abakola bye nhenda balyemba olw'eisanhu, aye imwe mwalira olw'enaku era mwawowoola olw'obulumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo be nalondamu balikozesanga eriina lyaimwe nga bakolima. Era imwe, nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze mwene ndibaita, aye abo abakola bye nhenda ndibatuuma eriina eiyaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo kyaba nti, ole bw'aneesabiranga okugheebwa enkabi, enkabi edho aidha kudhisabanga nze Katonda ow'amazima. N'ole bw'anaalayiranga, aidha kulayiranga nze Katonda ow'amazima kuba ebizibu ebyabita biriwaagho byerabirwa, naaba nga tikaabifaaku naire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
