            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.66.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 66:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 3:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 21:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Bona, buti ndi kutonda eigulu eiyaaka n'ensi empyaka. Era ebintu ebyabita tibiriidhukirwa waire okulowoozebwaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye musangaale era musagambe ebyanda n'ebyanda olw'ekyo kye ndi kutonda kuba Yerusalemu kye ndi kutonda kiriba kya kusagambiramu, n'abantu baamu baliba basangaavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 21:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nze mwene ndisangaala olwa Yerusalemu, era naasagamba olw'abantu bange abo. Tighalibaagho kabiri kukuba mpungu waire okulira amaziga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baliba tibakaafa nga bato, era abantu boonaboona balighangaalanga emyaka gyaibwe emiidhuvu. Abo abalighangaalanga emyaka ekikumi, balibalirwanga mu bato. Era ole okufa nga tagigheziiza, kalibanga kamanhiso ka kukolimirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu balizimba endhu baadhibaamu, era baasimba amasamba g'emizabbibu baalya ebibala byamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole talizimba ndhu, kabiri omuntu wundi n'agibaamu. Era ole talisimba kintu, kabiri owundi n'akirya. Ng'emiti bwe gighangaala emyaka kamaala, n'abantu bange batyo bwe balighangaala. Abantu bange abo be nalondamu, balirwagho nga bakaalya ku bintu byaibwe bye baafaabiikanira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emirimo gye balikola tibalidaagira bwereere. N'abaana be balizaala tibalituukibwaku kabi naire kuba nze Musengwa Katonda mwene ndibagha enkabi ghalala n'eizaire lyaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banaabanga bakaali na kundheta nga nabawuliire ira, era banaajanga okumala okunsaba nga nabaizeemu ira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
